+{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"82041063-33cd-408b-90a4-5837eb2a7c54","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the dev-server plugin. For this one I need to think carefully about the `interface DevServerConfig` since the tests use it:\n\n```typescript\ninterface DevServerConfig {\n  port: number;\n  routes: Array<{ path: string; handler: string }>;\n  assetPaths: string[];\n  searchIndexPath: string;\n}\n```\n\nI won't define this in the plugin file since it's only used by the test, but I need my plugin to produce an object matching this shape.\n\nLooking at the content routes test:\n```typescript\nit('config includes content routes', async () => {\n    const output = new Map<string, string>();\n    output.set('post-1.html', '<html></html>');\n    output.set('post-2.html', '<html></html>');\n    ...\n    const contentRoutes = config.routes.filter(r => r.handler === 'static');\n    expect(contentRoutes.length).toBe(2);\n});\n```\n\nSo for each `.html` page in the output, I need a route with handler 'static'. The path should probably be the URL path. Let me think about what path to use... The test doesn't check the specific paths, just the count. But I should use reasonable paths like `/${path}`.\n\nFor asset routes:\n```typescript\nconst assetRoutes = config.routes.filter(r => r.handler === 'asset');\nexpect(assetRoutes.length).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(2);\n```\n\nSo for each asset, I add a route with handler 'asset'. The path would be something like `/assets/image.png`.\n\nFor search index path:\n```typescript\nexpect(config.searchIndexPath).toBe('/search-index.json');\n```\n\nSimple - if search-index.json is in output, set path to '/search-index.json'.\n\nLet me also read the test for asset routes more carefully to see if the path comparison matters:\n```typescript\nconst assetRoutes = config.routes.filter(r => r.handler === 'asset');\nexpect(assetRoutes.length).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(2);\n```\n\nIt just checks the count and handler. Good.\n\nDefault port is 3000.","signature":"82041063-33cd-408b-90a4-5837eb2a7c54"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":52480,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ecb8ae7-28c2-43df-b356-b660233feb18","uuid":"2eb52e57-b1aa-4837-af4e-e0701cfa278a"}
+{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"82041063-33cd-408b-90a4-5837eb2a7c54","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_KxnUKttoLywdOFWsHaUj1282","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/src/plugins/dev-server.ts","content":"import { Plugin, BuildContext } from '../core/types.js';\n\ninterface DevServerRoute {\n  path: string;\n  handler: string;\n}\n\ninterface DevServerConfig {\n  port: number;\n  routes: DevServerRoute[];\n  assetPaths: string[];\n  searchIndexPath: string;\n}\n\nexport function createDevServerPlugin(): Plugin {\n  return {\n    name: 'dev-server',\n    version: '1.0.0',\n    dependencies: ['asset-pipeline', 'search-index'],\n    hooks: {\n      afterBuild(ctx: BuildContext): void {\n        const { output, data } = ctx;\n\n        const routes: DevServerRoute[] = [];\n\n        // Content routes from output pages\n        for (const [path] of output.entries()) {\n          if (path.endsWith('.html')) {\n            routes.push({ path: `/${path}`, handler: 'static' });\n          }\n        }\n\n        // Asset routes from asset-pipeline data\n        const manifest = data.get('asset-manifest') as { assets: string[] } | undefined;\n        const assetPaths: string[] = manifest?.assets || [];\n\n        for (const asset of assetPaths) {\n          routes.push({ path: `/assets/${asset}`, handler: 'asset' });\n        }\n\n        // Search index path\n        const searchIndexPath = output.has('search-index.json')\n          ? '/search-index.json'\n          : '';\n\n        const config: DevServerConfig = {\n          port: 3000,\n          routes,\n          assetPaths,\n          searchIndexPath,\n        };\n\n        ctx.data.set('dev-server-config', config);\n      },\n    },\n  };\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":52480,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"contex